6. THIRD-PARTY AND STANDARDS NOTICE

The Software is an independent implementation of the publicly documented
IEC 61850 protocol family. It is not derived from, and contains no code
copied or mechanically translated from, any other IEC 61850 implementation.
Interoperability with other implementations has been established by observing
protocol behaviour on the wire only.

The IEC 61850 standards are published by the International Electrotechnical
Commission and are subject to their own copyright. This License grants no
rights in the standards themselves, and no part of the standard text is
reproduced here beyond short factual references. Users requiring the normative
text must obtain it from the IEC.

This Software is not certified, endorsed or conformance-tested by the IEC, by
UCA International Users Group, or by any certification body.


